Package: kilix-95
Architecture: all
Depends: kilix (>= 0.2.3+packaging14), python3, python3-pil, python3-xlib,
 xauth, xvfb, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0
Description: Kilix 95, the default Kilix desktop
 Kilix 95 is a desktop drawn as pixels inside a Kilix pane: a taskbar and
 Start menu, windows, a file manager, settings, small applications and games,
 in the style of a late-1990s desktop.
 .
 This package installs it under /usr/share/kilix-95, where the kilix launcher
 finds it when no provider checkout is configured. Its settings, caches and
 state stay in each user's home.
